        "book.grammar",
        "grammar.plurals"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "बहुवचन के नियम: 1) ज़्यादातर में s: book → books। 2) s, sh, ch पर ख़त्म हो तो es: bus → buses। 3) व्यंजन + y हो तो ies: baby → babies। 4) स्वर (a, e, i, o, u) + y हो तो सिर्फ़ s: boy → boys।",
        "hinglish": "Bahuvachan ke niyam: 1) zyaadatar mein s: book → books. 2) s, sh, ch par khatm ho to es: bus → buses. 3) vyanjan + y ho to ies: baby → babies. 4) swar (a, e, i, o, u) + y ho to sirf s: boy → boys.",
        "en": "Plural rules: 1) Most add s: book → books. 2) Ending in s, sh, ch: add es: bus → buses. 3) Consonant + y: change to ies: baby → babies. 4) Vowel + y: just add s: boy → boys."
      }
    },
