      "text": {
        "hi": "बोलचाल में शब्द छोटे हो जाते हैं: I am → I'm, do not → don't। ’ (apostrophe) बताता है कि कोई अक्षर हटा है।",
        "hinglish": "Bolchaal mein shabd chhote ho jaate hain: I am → I'm, do not → don't. ’ (apostrophe) bataata hai ki koi akshar hata hai.",
        "en": "In speech, words get shorter: I am → I'm, do not → don't. The apostrophe (’) shows that letters are missing."
      }
    },
